{"description":"Message of a Timeline Entry on a evidence timeline stating, with no proof, that one operation entry is not to be processed in one document. The schema is open: the processor checks that document and operationEntry are the only fields and are well formed, and skips an entry that is not.","document":{"description":"Reference by content BlueId, {blueId: ...}, to the document by its initial BlueId, the same for every participant; the convention an Operation Request uses for its document. A free field: presence and form are checked by the processor, not by this schema."},"name":"Rejection Entry","operationEntry":{"description":"Reference by content BlueId, {blueId: ...}, to the operation's Timeline Entry. A free field: presence and form are checked by the processor, not by this schema."},"specification":{"blueId":"DKSQLfTLQncVfoJL85NQHoShR36YD5U5t8zdqPgUdEcr"}}
